OL,3,APope's health should not be taken 'for
OL,4,Agranted', says top Vatican diplomat
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV's health should not be
OL,7,Ftaken "for granted", a British senior
OL,8,FVatican official told the BBC.
OL,10,FArchbishop Paul Gallagher, the
OL,11,FVatican's foreign minister since 2014,
OL,12,Fsaid the news of the Pope's ill health
OL,13,Fwas "a bit of a game changer", adding
OL,14,F"it's going to make things a bit
OL,15,Fdifferent".
OL,17,FThe Pope was diagnosed with lung
OL,18,Fadenocarcinoma following surgery to
OL,19,Fremove a lower lobe of his right lung.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
