OL,3,APope's health should not be taken 'for
OL,4,Agranted', says top Vatican diplomat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on Tuesday after the Pope's
OL,7,Foperation was announced, but before his
OL,8,Fcancer diagnosis, Archbishop Gallagher
OL,9,Fsaid: "I think we were maybe taking him
OL,10,Fa little bit for granted."
